<title>UK: Ashbourne says receives possible bid offer.</title>
<headline>Ashbourne says receives possible bid offer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ashbourne Plc said on Monday that it has received an offer which may lead to an offer being made for the company.</p>
<p>It said a further announcment would be made as soon as practicable.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
